## Course Delivery Format

### Video Lessons

Each module includes 4-6 video lessons ranging from 20-45 minutes. Videos combine lecture, demonstration, and guided practices.

### Downloadable Workbooks

Each module includes a comprehensive workbook with exercises, reflection prompts, journaling pages, and practical applications.

### Audio Guides

Guided meditations, breathwork sessions, and toning exercises in audio format for daily practice support.

### Community Access

Private community forum for connecting with fellow students, asking questions, and sharing experiences.

### Lifetime Updates

Access to all future course updates and additions as the curriculum evolves.

