## Prerequisites and Requirements

### Required Materials

- Journal dedicated to lunar practice
- Access to outdoor or window viewing of the moon
- Headphones for audio practices (high quality recommended)
- Optional: singing bowl, tuning fork, or drum for sound work

### Recommended Preparation

- Familiarity with basic astrological concepts (helpful but not required)
- Openness to working with subtle energies
- Commitment to daily practice of at least 10-15 minutes
- Willingness to observe and document personal patterns

