## Why This Course Is Different

### Comprehensive, Not Superficial

Most lunar courses offer surface-level guidance— "start new projects on the new moon." This course provides deep understanding of why lunar timing works and how to apply it in sophisticated, personalized ways.

### Science-Informed Philosophy

We honor both the mystical wisdom of lunar traditions and the insights of modern science. You will understand resonance physics, brainwave entrainment, and chronobiology as they relate to lunar living.

### Practical, Actionable Tools

Every concept connects to practical application. You will leave not just knowing but doing—with specific tools, practices, and protocols for every lunar phase and situation.

### Holistic Integration

Phasecraft integrates sound, breath, movement, intention, and astrology into a unified system. Rather than learning disconnected techniques, you develop a coherent practice that amplifies all elements.

